[agent] 3. **Pinned the cause**: inspecting matched pairs showed the exact relationship `train_f5 = ln(1 + serve_f5)` (equivalently `serve_f5 = exp(train_f5) − 1`), verified across all 200 rows with max error ~6e-7 (float rounding).
[agent] **Cause:** the training pipeline applies a `log1p` (log of 1+x) transform when computing f5, but the online serving path serves the raw untransformed value — a missing log transform in the serving feature computation.
